BT 1 0 0 1 0 112.1085 Tm .464186 Tw 14.91 TL /F2 10.5 Tf .066667 .066667 .066667 rg (A: LMN, Inc. is a common carrier and it is not absolved by the storm, since it sailed into a known danger and the law) Tj T* 0 Tw (imputes the package fare as compensation.) Tj  T* 1.541288 Tw (Its boats carry guests by water for the imputed fare inside the resort package, and Art. 1732 reaches ancillary and) Tj T* 0 Tw (narrow-client carriage so long as the service is offered to whoever books the resort.) Tj  T* 1.126814 Tw (The storm defense fails because the forecast preceded the sailing and the captain chose to brave it, which keeps the) Tj T* 0 Tw (human fault concurrent with the waves and defeats the fortuity claim.) Tj  T* 1.927057 Tw (Death therefore raises the presumption of fault, and only proof of extraordinary diligence could rebut it, which a) Tj T* 0 Tw (voluntary voyage into a forecasted storm cannot supply.) Tj T* ET
