BT 1 0 0 1 0 112.182 Tm 1.16488 Tw 14.91 TL /F4 10.5 Tf .066667 .066667 .066667 rg (2023 Bar Q: Hari and Reyna booked a honeymoon package at Anya Resort \(AR\) in Palawan which included) Tj T* 0 Tw .219185 Tw (transportation from Batangas to Palawan, and vice versa, via M/B Prinsesa owned and operated by AR. Despite) Tj T* 0 Tw .439029 Tw (PAGASA storm warning bulletins, M/B Prinsesa proceeded to ferry Hari and Reyna from the port of Batangas) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.649665 Tw (to Palawan. While in open seas, the boat was hit by big waves and eventually capsized, drowning Hari and) Tj T* 0 Tw .374498 Tw (Reyna. When sued by the heirs of the couple, AR denied liability on the ground that it is not a common carrier,) Tj T* 0 Tw .454415 Tw (as M/B Prinsesa is not available to the general public or other tourists, and exclusively ferries resort guests and) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.42241 Tw (crew members. AR further argued that they did not charge Hari and Reyna separate fees to board M/B) Tj T* 0 Tw (Prinsesa. Are the arguments of AR correct? Discuss your answer.) Tj T* ET
