BT 1 0 0 1 0 112.1085 Tm .295998 Tw 14.91 TL /F2 10.5 Tf .066667 .066667 .066667 rg (A: The arguments of AR are incorrect, since the resort boat is a common carrier and sailing into the storm breached its) Tj T* 0 Tw (utmost diligence.) Tj  T* 2.647748 Tw (The boat carries guests by water for the imputed fare inside the package, and Art. 1732 reaches ancillary and) Tj T* 0 Tw (narrow-client carriage so long as the service is offered to whoever books the resort.) Tj  T* .174077 Tw (The storm defense fails because the bulletins preceded the sailing and the captain chose to brave them, which keeps the) Tj T* 0 Tw (human fault concurrent with the waves and defeats the fortuity claim.) Tj  T* 1.927057 Tw (Death therefore raises the presumption of fault, and only proof of extraordinary diligence could rebut it, which a) Tj T* 0 Tw (voluntary voyage into a forecasted storm cannot supply.) Tj T* ET
