BT 1 0 0 1 0 291.102 Tm 4.030145 Tw 14.91 TL /F4 10.5 Tf .066667 .066667 .066667 rg (2018 Bar Q: Ysidro, a paying passenger, was on board Bus No. 904 owned and operated by Yatco) Tj T* 0 Tw 3.148598 Tw (Transportation Company \(Yatco\). He boarded the bus at Munoz, Nueva Ecija with Manila as his final) Tj T* 0 Tw .763998 Tw (destination. He was seated on the first row, window seat on the left side of the bus. As the bus was negotiating) Tj T* 0 Tw .444498 Tw (the national highway in front of the public market of Gerona, Tarlac, the bus came to a full stop because of the) Tj T* 0 Tw .517839 Tw (traffic. The driver of the bus took this opportunity to check on the tires of the bus and to relieve himself. As he) Tj T* 0 Tw .779761 Tw (was alighting from the bus to do these, an unidentified man standing along the highway hurled a huge rock at) Tj T* 0 Tw .675314 Tw (the left side of the bus and hit Ysidro between his eyes. He lost consciousness and immediately the driver, with) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.259446 Tw (the conductor, drove the bus to bring him to the nearest hospital. He expired before the bus could reach the) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.681233 Tw (hospital. Ysidro's wife and children brought a civil action to collect damages from Yatco, alleging that as a) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.637298 Tw (common carrier, it was required to exercise extraordinary diligence in ensuring the safety of its passengers.) Tj T* 0 Tw .307123 Tw (They contended that, in case of injuries and/or death on the part of any of its passengers, the common carrier is) Tj T* 0 Tw .444498 Tw (presumed to be at fault. In its defense, Yatco alleged that it is not an absolute insurer of its passengers and that) Tj T* 0 Tw .292893 Tw (Ysidro's death was not due to any defect in the means of transport or method of transporting passengers, or the) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.27713 Tw (negligent acts of its employees. Since the accident was due to the fault of a stranger over whom the common) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.154044 Tw (carrier had no control, or of which it did not have any prior knowledge to be able to prevent it, the cause of) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.749998 Tw (Ysidro's death should be considered a fortuitous event and not the liability of the common carrier. \(a\) Is a) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.008581 Tw (common carrier presumed to be at fault whenever there is death or injury to its passengers, regardless of the) Tj T* 0 Tw .877024 Tw (cause of death or injury? \(2.5%\) \(b\) What kind of diligence is required of common carriers like Yatco for the) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.120446 Tw (protection of its passengers? \(2.5%\) \(c\) Will your answer be the same as your answer in \(b\) above, if the) Tj T* 0 Tw (assailant was another paying passenger who boarded the bus and deliberately stabbed Ysidro to death? \(2.5%\)) Tj T* ET
