BT 1 0 0 1 0 82.362 Tm .116733 Tw 14.91 TL /F4 10.5 Tf .066667 .066667 .066667 rg (2016 Bar Q: Nautica Shipping Lines \(Nautica\) bought a second hand passenger ship from Japan. It modified the) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.526415 Tw (design of the bulkhead of the deck of the ship to accommodate more passengers. The ship sunk with its) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.176586 Tw (passengers in Tablas Strait due to heavy rains brought by the monsoon. The heirs of the passengers sued) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.715821 Tw (Nautica for its liability as a common carrier based on the reconfiguration of the bulkhead which may have) Tj T* 0 Tw .632331 Tw (compromised the stability of the ship. Nautica raised the defense that the monsoon is a fortuitous event and, at) Tj T* 0 Tw (most, its liability is prescribed by the Limited Liability Rule. Decide with reasons. \(5%\)) Tj T* ET
