BT 1 0 0 1 0 112.1085 Tm 1.018998 Tw 14.91 TL /F2 10.5 Tf .066667 .066667 .066667 rg (A: The PNR answers though Juan was also at fault, since the broken barrier and the last clear chance keep the train) Tj T* 0 Tw (operator liable while Juan fault never travels to his passengers.) Tj  T* 1.617551 Tw (The carrier and operator owe utmost diligence over the line with working warnings, and a barrier left broken at a) Tj T* 0 Tw (known congested crossing breaches that diligence before any jeepney stalls.) Tj  T* .38684 Tw (Juan breached his own motorist duty by entering rails he could not clear, so his personal claim suffers his contributory) Tj T* 0 Tw (fault under the avoidable-consequences and last-clear-chance sorting.) Tj  T* .293998 Tw (Kim and the riding passengers recover in full, since the driver negligence is not imputed to them and the PNR with the) Tj T* 0 Tw (final opportunity to stop must answer for the injuries its train inflicted.) Tj T* ET
