BT 1 0 0 1 0 112.1085 Tm .989498 Tw 14.91 TL /F2 10.5 Tf .066667 .066667 .066667 rg (A: LMN, Inc. is a common carrier, yet it keeps no fortuity defense since its own decision to sail concurred with the) Tj T* 0 Tw (storm.) Tj  T* 1.660165 Tw (The boats ferry guests by water for the imputed fare inside the resort package, and narrow clientele never defeats) Tj T* 0 Tw (common character where the service is held out to whoever books the resort.) Tj  T* .331057 Tw (The storm was forecasted and the service stood cancelled, so sailing to appease guests with engine trouble mid-voyage) Tj T* 0 Tw (keeps human fault beside the waves and breaks the proximate-and-only-cause demand of Art. 1739.) Tj  T* .992248 Tw (Death therefore raises the presumption of fault, and only proof of utmost diligence could rebut it, which a voluntary) Tj T* 0 Tw (voyage into a forecasted storm cannot supply.) Tj T* ET
