BT 1 0 0 1 0 82.2885 Tm 14.91 TL /F2 10.5 Tf .066667 .066667 .066667 rg (A: The fire plea has a narrow path while the blowout plea has almost none, since diligence decides both.) Tj  T* 2.126831 Tw (Fire sits outside the five Art. 1734 causes, so the warehouseman carrier stays presumed at fault and must prove) Tj T* 0 Tw (extraordinary diligence with watchmen, wiring, extinguishers, and segregation fully shown.) Tj  T* .124763 Tw (The bald tires prove want of roadworthiness by themselves, so the blowout is carrier-side unfitness rather than calamity) Tj T* 0 Tw (and the presumption stands unrebutted.) Tj  T* (The sugar claim therefore turns on the diligence proof while the bus claim fails on the treads alone.) Tj T* ET
