rified provision) Tj T* 0 Tw .587998 Tw (texts rather than as book assertions. Amendatory and related laws are dated in text, namely the Code of Commerce of) Tj T* 0 Tw .119794 Tw (1888, the Civil Code of 1950, P.D. No. 1755 of 1980, Commonwealth Act No. 65 of 1936, R.A. No. 4136 of 1964, and) Tj T* 0 Tw (the Montreal Convention adopted in 1999. No invented statute, docket, or holding is asserted.) Tj T* ET
