BT 1 0 0 1 0 52.4685 Tm .045498 Tw 14.91 TL /F2 10.5 Tf .066667 .066667 .066667 rg (A: She collects no moral sum, since clean breach without fraud or bad faith draws only actual loss under Art. 2220. The) Tj T* 0 Tw 3.104717 Tw (refund quenches the pecuniary part and the prompt apology negates the spite that moral requires. Her ruined) Tj T* 0 Tw .836997 Tw (photographs, though genuinely painful, sound in unproved consequence rather than in Art. 2217 anguish proximately) Tj T* 0 Tw (tied to a wrongful manner. The claim therefore ends with the refunded fare.) Tj T* ET
