ed in text, namely) Tj T* 0 Tw .500998 Tw (the Code of Commerce of 1888, the Civil Code of 1950, P.D. No. 1755 of 1980, Commonwealth Act No. 65 of 1936,) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.686415 Tw (R.A. No. 4136 of 1964, and the Montreal Convention adopted in 1999. No invented statute, docket, or holding is) Tj T* 0 Tw (asserted.) Tj T* ET
