atim from the Bar Questions compilation,) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.809404 Tw (and no verbatim Montreal Convention, denied-boarding, or tariff question exists in the 2016 to 2025 bank, so) Tj T* 0 Tw .359915 Tw (remaining drills are drafted without years. Case citations and dates come from the Batch 2 Case List with consolidated) Tj T* 0 Tw .279998 Tw (dockets reduced to the first number. Amendatory and related laws are dated in text, namely the Chicago Convention of) Tj T* 0 Tw .472498 Tw (1944, the Civil Aeronautics Act as R.A. No. 776 of 1952, the Civil Code of 1950, the Civil Aviation Authority Act as) Tj T* 0 Tw .691893 Tw (R.A. No. 9497 of 2008, the Air Passenger Bill of Rights as 2012 regulation, and the Montreal Convention adopted in) Tj T* 0 Tw (1999. No invented statute, docket, or holding is asserted.) Tj T* ET
